  "id": "chicken-and-gravy",
  "name": "Chicken and Gravy",
  "subtitle": "Tender seasoned chicken with savory pan gravy",
  "description": "Seasoned chicken breasts are pressure-cooked with stock, then finished with a quick cornstarch-thickened gravy.",
